(text "Miata ECU motherboard 2001-2005 (NB2, VVT). Carries the year-specific harness header and the year-independent I/O (wideband, MAP, IAT, USB-C). All engine control is on the daughterboard." (at 30.48 100.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e78670e9-a2d0-4859-8236-b406c2ade74e)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))